	(descr "Dual footprint, fit ONE: USB-A Molex 67643 (0676430910/0676432910/0676433910, SD-67643-003) OR USB-C USB2.0 GCT USB4085-GF-A (all pins THT, 0.40 mm holes, https://gct.co/files/drawings/usb4085.pdf). Origin on the PCB edge line; both front faces 1.5 mm beyond the edge. Pads: 1 VBUS, 2 D-, 3 D+, 4 GND, 5 CC1, 6 CC2 (USB-C only), SH shell; USB-C SBU pads unnumbered. USB-C signal pads tented on top (solder from the back).")
